room after normal movement and block-cracking inputs.","src","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/minimal-rogue-claude.webp","alt","Minimal Rogue first-floor gameplay with the player, breakable blocks, corridor, HP and stamina HUD, and block-cracking log.","https://hirotaka-adachi.itch.io/minimal-rogue","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型","items",[86],"Claude Code","links","相关资源",[92],"resourceIds","section",{"_61":86,"_25":93},"/zh/resources/claude-code/","创作者开发记录",[97],"evidence",{"_61":98,"_25":74,"_99":100},"Read the author’s Claude Code and SUNO attribution","note","The creator identifies Claude Code for development, SUNO AI for music, links the complete repository and explicitly describes the work as created entirely using AI. No model version or full development transcript is supplied.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[105],{"_61":106,"_25":107,"_99":108},"查看完整游戏项目","https://github.com/HirotakaAdachi/Rogue/tree/anonymous-release","Complete static HTML/CSS/JavaScript project and four MP3 tracks; serve the root over HTTP without a package install or build step. MIT code license is included; SUNO music is credited without a separate music license. The reviewed public source index references script version 549, while the itch build references 581, so the two releases are not claimed to be byte-identical.","获取方式","playable","demo","试玩与运行",[114],{"_61":115,"_25":74,"_99":116},"Play Minimal Rogue on itch.io","Browser keyboard game. Enter confirms the opening and tutorial; arrows move, Space defends, and X opens the menu. A short first-floor run verified movement, block-cracking feedback and the command menu. Later floors, saves and a complete run were not tested.","游戏平台","itch.io","指南形式","disclosure","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[124],{"_61":125,"_25":74,"_99":-7},"Read the creator’s AI and source-code notes","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[130,131,132,133],"运行网页游戏，选择新游戏与语言，用 Enter 推进开场和教程。","用方向键探索首个房间，Space 防御，X 打开指令菜单。","阅读作者的 AI 披露，检查完整 HTML、CSS、JavaScript 和音乐文件。","通过 HTTP 提供源码目录，修改一项房间或体力规则，检查移动、交互和新一局流程。","AI 工作流与开发背景","Hirotaka Adachi 将开发工具归为 Claude Code，音乐归为 SUNO AI，并称作品完全由 AI 制作，但没有给出确切编程模型。公开项目包含渲染器、规则、界面和四首音乐；作者的这一表述不等于没有人工指导的自主开发。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 生成（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","2D","track","metadata","引擎","Canvas 2D · Vanilla JavaScript · HTML/CSS UI","engine","lead","2d","ai-generated",{"_61":125,"_25":74,"_17":120},{"_61":115,"_25":74,"_17":110,"_99":116},{"_61":158,"_25":107,"_159":160,"_99":108},{"_61":98,"_25":74,"_99":100},[157],"claude-code","Open the complete game project","scope","complete-project",{"_162":163},"documents",{"_66":164,"_35":165},[167,171,172,173,170,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,169,206,168,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224],[166,167,168,169,170],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-design/LICENSE","skills/level-design/references/blockout-metrics","skills/level-des